  "kernel_build": "Repository firmware-owned UEFI experiment with its 32 MiB load-base patch; full heap. The USB used the upstream loader and passed the real GOP framebuffer descriptor to PCP OS. All five guests used the same read-only experimental USB.",
  "firmware_source": "https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/e/edk2/edk2_2025.02.orig.tar.xz",
